Experience the freedom and immersion of an all new open world and mission structure with settings such as the rooftops and canals of beautiful Venice. Your options in combat, assassination and escape are vast, with many new weapons, settings and gameplay elements.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/assassin-s-creed-ii', '["PlayStation 3", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 8.8, 0, 7.01, '2026-11-21 13:07:40', '2026-11-21 13:07:40')
